  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the warmth of the holiday season with the Cardinal Quilt by Jeminise. This beautiful bedding piece features a festive winter design, perfect for adding a cozy Christmas touch to your bedroom or guest room. Whether you are using it as a bed quilt, a couch throw, or taking it along on your next camping trip, this versatile quilt provides consistent comfort and lightweight warmth.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalization options may include size selection, optional pillowcases, or custom text input to make it uniquely yours.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Winter Bird Design:</strong> Features a beautifully matched cardinal and winter pattern to create a warm holiday atmosphere.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Material:</strong> Crafted with a breathable soft polyester outer fabric and filled with high-quality silk floss for maximum comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 5 different sizes including Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (102x91 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Multi-functional design makes it ideal as a bed quilt, picnic mat, couch throw blanket, or outdoor camping gear.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Conveniently machine washable in cold water, drying quickly to remain fluffy and soft.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Xmas Red Bird-03</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Animal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Bird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt + Pillowcase( Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
